KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ emplace with mixed value categories: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Header-free mimic of libstdc++'s unordered_map, cvise-reduced from
cpp17_umap_emplace_mixed_categories with a valgrind gate to exclude
undefined-behaviour degeneration.  The hashtable class template is
reached through an alias template whose default argument computes a
bool non-type parameter; the emplace() member's increment on the
NSDMI-initialised counter is lost and the size assertion wrongly
fails.  g++ and clang++ accept and run clean (exit 0).
